      <h3 id="olm-operatorgroups-about_olm-understanding-olm" class="group scroll-mt-20">Operator groups<a href="#olm-operatorgroups-about_olm-understanding-olm" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p class="_abstract">An Operator group defines multitenant configuration for OLM-installed Operators through an <code>OperatorGroup</code> resource. An Operator group selects target namespaces where the required RBAC access is generated for member Operators .</p>
      <p>The set of target namespaces is provided by a comma-delimited string stored in the <code>olm.targetNamespaces</code> annotation of a cluster service version (CSV). This annotation is applied to the CSV instances of member Operators and is projected into their deployments.</p>
